  "knownLimitations": [
    "BundledJdkLocator now resolves the packaged Windows jdk/bin/java.exe before source-tree JDK layouts, task-level BUNDLED_JDK_MISSING diagnostics pass, and a fresh export flat-JDK testmod2 build succeeds; the release gate remains blocked until these changes are committed and replayed through the selected installed candidate's desktop runClient path.",
